# Personal Incarnation under an opponent's control: "Only this creature's owner may activate this ability" (CR 602.2) and
# "its owner" (the rulings: the owner loses life, not the controller). Bot2 takes Bot1's Incarnation with Control Magic.
# Bot2, its controller, may not activate it; Bot1, its owner, may. Bot2's Lightning Bolt to it then deals 1 to Bot1 - its
# owner, not the effect's or the creature's controller - and 2 to it. Bot2's Terror destroys it: the trigger is Bot2's,
# but Bot1, its owner, at 19 loses 10, rounded up, and Bot2 loses nothing.

